    // ── GOOGLE SHEET SETUP ───────────────────────────────────────────
    // To show products from a Google Sheet:
    //   1. Open your Google Sheet
    //   2. Go to File → Share → Publish to web
    //   3. Choose your products tab → select "Comma-separated values (.csv)"
    //   4. Click Publish, then copy the URL shown
    //   5. Paste it below (between the quotes)
    //
    // The sheet must have these column headers in row 1:
    //   Name | Category | Price | Sale Price | Unit | Description | Badge | Image | Emoji | Stock | Rating
    //
    //   Name        — e.g.  Don Julio 1942
    //   Category    — e.g.  Tequila, Scotch Whisky, Red Wine, Craft Beer
    //   Price       — number only, no $ sign  (e.g.  159.99)
    //   Unit        — short label after price  (e.g.  btl, 6-pk, 750ml)
    //   Description — one-line detail  (e.g.  Añejo Tequila · 750ml)
    //   Badge       — optional promo tag  (e.g.  Top Seller, On Sale) — leave blank for none
    //   Image       — direct URL to the product photo (paste any image link, e.g. from the brand's
    //                 website or Google Drive). To use a Google Drive image: upload the photo, click
    //                 "Share" → "Anyone with the link", then change the URL from
    //                 .../file/d/FILE_ID/view  →  https://drive.google.com/uc?id=FILE_ID
    //                 Leave blank to show the emoji instead.
    //   Emoji       — fallback emoji shown if Image is blank  (e.g.  🥃  🍷  🍺  🍾  🌵)
    //   Stock       — quantity in stock (e.g.  24). Shows green "X in stock", orange "X left — order
    //                 soon" when 5 or fewer, and grayed out "Out of stock" when 0. Leave blank to
    //                 hide the indicator entirely.
    //   Rating      — customer rating out of 5, supports one decimal (e.g.  4.5). Shown as stars
    //                 in the product detail popup. Leave blank to hide the rating.
    const SHEET_CSV_URL = 'https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vToDgWVzefEfIypyl2AtUdAGksHtSuD0LRp8NLE6pZ_KjGXHDhiyUI02PGcXbZhqKtEPuYRUfaBUK1m/pub?gid=0&single=true&output=csv'; // ← Paste your Google Sheet CSV URL here

